              "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}2^{3(x+1)}&=2^1\\times2^{2(x-1)}\\\\2^{3x+3}&=2^{2x-1}\\\\3x+3&=2x-1\\\\x+3&=-1\\\\x&=-4\\end{align*}$$",
